+---
+id: lem-qftx-asd-penrose-kernel-vanishing
+kind: lemma
+title: Conditional Penrose vanishing from positive scalar curvature
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+page: qftx-adhm-zero-fi-asd-correspondence
+dependency_level: 6
