+---
+id: def-qftx-donaldson-adhm-matrix-convention
+kind: definition
+title: Donaldson's ADHM matrix equations in the source convention
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+page: qftx-adhm-zero-fi-asd-correspondence
+dependency_level: 0
